    "projectNameAr": "مصنع سافكو-5 لإنتاج اليوريا ",
    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">The project aims at establishing a urea plant with a production capacity of 1.1mn tpa and with a total investments of SAR 2bn.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
